        "section_text_block_qcH9WV": {
          "type": "_section-text-block",
          "settings": {
            "max_width": 100,
            "color_scheme": "scheme-4",
            "twi_max_width": 115,
            "twi_center": false,
            "twi_margin": 60,
            "show_as_card": false,
            "color_scheme_show_as_card": "",
            "narrow_width": false,
            "text_button_split": false,
            "merging_with_section_below": false,
            "color_scheme_layout_merging": "",
            "merging_color": "#bcecf6",
            "merge_with_section_above": false,
            "padding_top": 64,
            "padding_bottom": 64,
            "top_left": false,
            "top_right": true,
            "bottom_right": false,
            "bottom_left": false,
            "corner_color": "#bcecf6",
            "custom_css": "@media screen and (max-width: 749px){[TT_CSS] .ssky-text-block__text {text-align: center}}"
          },
          "blocks": {
            "heading_wXwicz": {
              "type": "heading",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "<p>The Truth Is… as a Parent, You May Feel as if You Are Not <br/>Informed Enough to Teach Your Children These Ideas</p>",
                "custom_color": "",
                "alignment": "center",
                "heading_size": "h4",
                "heading_weight": "bold",
                "heading_tag": "h2",
                "margin_top": 0,
                "margin_bottom": 0,
                "custom_css": ""
              }
            },
            "text_with_icon_RejtNA": {
              "type": "_text-with-icon",
              "settings": {
                "alignment": "left",
                "text_size": "medium",
                "text_weight": "regular",
                "icon": "shopify://shop_images/icon-one.webp",
                "icon_svg": "",
                "text": "<p><strong>Are you concerned you don’t have the knowledge or confidence to teach your kids about ideas of freedom and how they relate to their life?</strong> Hoping that, somehow, they will be curious enough to figure it out for themselves?</p>",
                "custom_color": "",
                "icon_b": "shopify://shop_images/icon-two.webp",
                "icon_b_svg": "",
                "text_b": "<p><strong>Are you afraid schools are promoting an agenda that will diminish the freedom and individuality of your children?</strong> Perhaps you’re feeling in the dark about what they are learning and concerned they will grow up to believe false ideas.</p>",
                "margin_top": 0,
                "margin_bottom": 0,
                "custom_color_b": "",
                "custom_css": ""
              }
            },
            "text_with_icon_TFCjQF": {
              "type": "_text-with-icon",
              "settings": {
                "alignment": "left",
                "text_size": "medium",
                "text_weight": "regular",
                "icon": "shopify://shop_images/icon-three.webp",
                "icon_svg": "",
                "text": "<p><strong>Do you want to find educational resources to teach your child true principles, but don't know where to look?</strong> It’s hard to know what's aligned with your values, and ideas, and even to know which messages you want to share with your family.</p>",
                "custom_color": "",
                "icon_b": "shopify://shop_images/icon-one.webp",
                "icon_b_svg": "",
                "text_b": "<p><strong>Do you question whether your kids will be interested in (or even understand) these real-world concepts?</strong> Perhaps you barely understand them yourself, and you wonder how to help your children become well rounded in learning these ideas.</p>",
                "margin_top": 0,
                "margin_bottom": 0,
                "custom_color_b": "",
                "custom_css": ""
              }
            },
            "text_with_icon_xXyTqY": {
              "type": "_text-with-icon",
              "settings": {
                "alignment": "left",
                "text_size": "medium",
                "text_weight": "regular",
                "icon": "shopify://shop_images/icon-four.webp",
                "icon_svg": "",
                "text": "<p><strong>Are you worried about your kids being ignorant or apathetic about the values you believe in?</strong> If you can’t guide them, your kids will absorb ideas and agendas from their peers and social media.</p>",
                "custom_color": "",
                "icon_b_svg": "",
                "text_b": "",
                "margin_top": 0,
                "margin_bottom": 0,
                "custom_color_b": "",
                "custom_css": ""
              }
            },
            "divider_zjwjj4": {
              "type": "_divider",
              "settings": {
                "margin": 40,
                "contrast": true,
                "margin_top": 0,
                "margin_bottom": 0,
                "custom_css": ""
              }
            },
            "text_GQHkyn": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "max_width": 69,
                "custom_color": "",
                "alignment": "left",
                "text": "<p><strong>After all, you only have one shot at helping shape your children's worldview before the noise of today's society takes over. </strong>Fortunately, you are not alone. You no longer need to feel as though you have no voice. And you can let go worrying that your children are not receiving the quality of education that they deserve.</p>",
                "text_size": "medium",
                "text_weight": "regular",
                "margin_top": 0,
                "margin_bottom": 0,
                "custom_css": ""
              }
            }
          },
          "block_order": [
            "heading_wXwicz",
            "text_with_icon_RejtNA",
            "text_with_icon_TFCjQF",
            "text_with_icon_xXyTqY",
            "divider_zjwjj4",
            "text_GQHkyn"
          ]
        },
        "section_text_block_jn7HDJ": {
          "type": "_section-text-block",
          "settings": {
            "max_width": 120,
            "color_scheme": "",
            "twi_max_width": 102,
            "twi_center": false,
            "twi_margin": 32,
            "show_as_card": false,
            "color_scheme_show_as_card": "",
            "narrow_width": false,
            "text_button_split": false,
            "merging_with_section_below": false,
            "color_scheme_layout_merging": "",
            "merging_color": "#bcecf6",
            "merge_with_section_above": false,
            "padding_top": 80,
            "padding_bottom": 0,
            "top_left": true,
            "top_right": false,
            "bottom_right": false,
            "bottom_left": false,
            "corner_color": "#3f3939",
            "custom_css": "@media screen and (max-width: 749px){[TT_CSS] .ssky-text-block__text {text-align: center}}"
          },
          "blocks": {
            "heading_zrmceT": {
              "type": "heading",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "<p>More Than Anything… You Simply Desire to Have a Healthy, <br/>Well-Rounded Family That Has Not Been Manipulated by <br/>Media and Government Agendas.</p>",
                "custom_color": "",
                "alignment": "center",
                "heading_size": "h3",
                "heading_weight": "bold",
                "heading_tag": "h2",
                "margin_top": 0,
                "margin_bottom": 0,
                "custom_css": ""
              }
            },
            "text_ercDF9": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "max_width": 72,
                "custom_color": "",
                "alignment": "center",
                "text": "<p>But it often feels like you are navigating an endless minefield to make this happen… right?</p>",
                "text_size": "extra-extra-large",
                "text_weight": "medium",
                "margin_top": 0,
                "margin_bottom": 0,
                "custom_css": ""
              }
            },
            "text_dgJYTJ": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "max_width": 120,
                "custom_color": "",
                "alignment": "center",
                "text": "<p>You have probably tried in the past to educate your kids on what’s happening in our world and struggled:</p>",
                "text_size": "medium",
                "text_weight": "semibold",
                "margin_top": 0,
                "margin_bottom": 0,
                "custom_css": ""
              }
            },
            "text_with_icon_GDHddF": {
              "type": "_text-with-icon",
              "settings": {
                "alignment": "left",
                "text_size": "medium",
                "text_weight": "regular",
                "icon": "shopify://shop_images/icon-sad.webp",
                "icon_svg": "",
                "text": "<p>A trip to the <strong>Local Library </strong>in search of good literature results in frustration that many books are pushing harmful agendas that are appealing to kids. You wonder what good material you can introduce to your children that they’ll actually enjoy.</p>",
                "custom_color": "",
                "icon_b": "shopify://shop_images/icon-sad.webp",
                "icon_b_svg": "",
                "text_b": "<p>After finding <strong>YouTube Videos</strong> from creators that seemed good at the time for your kids, you discovered that they ultimately had some agenda and were using their platform to promote ideas you strongly disagree with.</p>",
                "margin_top": 0,
                "margin_bottom": 0,
                "custom_color_b": "",
                "custom_css": ""
              }
            },
            "text_with_icon_yygazU": {
              "type": "_text-with-icon",
              "settings": {
                "alignment": "left",
                "text_size": "medium",
                "text_weight": "regular",
                "icon": "shopify://shop_images/icon-sad.webp",
                "icon_svg": "",
                "text": "<p>You have broached big subjects in <strong>Family Discussions </strong>after dinner that end up in silence from apathetic kids or end awkwardly when your kids ask questions you can’t answer.</p>",
                "custom_color": "",
                "icon_b": "shopify://shop_images/icon-sad.webp",
                "icon_b_svg": "",
                "text_b": "<p>Perhaps you use <strong>Current Events</strong> to try and educate your child about what is happening but there is no context and it’s too complex to explain. Often, you wonder if what you’re doing is enough to “stick” and prepare your children for the world they’re growing up in.</p>",
                "margin_top": 0,
                "margin_bottom": 0,
                "custom_color_b": "",
                "custom_css": ""
              }
            },
            "text_6GwBNC": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "max_width": 92,
                "custom_color": "",
                "alignment": "left",
                "text": "<p>Your kids are sometimes left with more questions than answers, and you can’t bear the thought of them getting lost at sea in all the manipulation and power games playing out in the world. <br/><br/>What if the solution to this emerging education problem was simpler than you thought?</p>",
                "text_size": "medium",
                "text_weight": "semibold",
                "margin_top": 0,
                "margin_bottom": 0,
                "custom_css": ""
              }
            }
          },
          "block_order": [
            "heading_zrmceT",
            "text_ercDF9",
            "text_dgJYTJ",
            "text_with_icon_GDHddF",
            "text_with_icon_yygazU",
            "text_6GwBNC"
          ]
        },
        "section_text_block_TNaN6t": {
