        "text_cDVWkK": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "max_width": 94,
            "custom_color": "",
            "alignment": "center",
            "text": "<p>Each of our books come with discussion questions at the end, helping you have amazing conversations with your children about these rich ideas. And as a bonus, we’re including our 14 PDF Activity Workbooks full of projects, worksheets, and more to help reinforce these new ideas in your child’s mind. We get emails daily from parents who are blown away at how much they learned alongside their children—and how their conversations over dinner have “leveled up” by talking about real-world concepts about what’s happening in the world. </p><p></p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
