          "settings": {
            "max_width": 83,
            "custom_color": "",
            "alignment": "left",
            "text": "<p>Amid the ever-growing problems facing the next generation, true education has never been so important to defend. The Tuttle Twins books are a great way to instill a respect for the ideas of liberty in your children and help them understand the principles of a free society, before it's too late.</p>",
