    "ssky_text_image_block_8UxBAH": {
      "type": "ssky-text-image-block",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_7V9HLp": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<p>These Are More Than Just Children’s Books</p>",
            "heading_size": "h0",
            "heading_weight": "bold",
            "heading_tag": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_974eMD": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The Tuttle Twins Series Has the Power to Change Your Life and the Lives of Your Children</p>",
            "text_size": "extra-extra-large",
            "text_weight": "semibold"
          }
        },
        "text_CDQgUB": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>These books will provide your kids with a solid foundation in civics, history and economics that they can build upon for the rest of their lives. Our books make it fun and easy to teach them (and yourself) the core principles of a free society.<br/><br/>We believe that knowledge is power. These books instill knowledge, foster understanding, and encourage critical thinking. You will love the approachable style and enjoy the facts, insights, and guidance you won’t find anywhere else.</p>",
